From: Camera Firmware Integration <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] ci: cover new sources and keep bootstrap peers unscoped

Include non-ignored new C++ files in the format and analysis gate, preserving
whitespace in paths and excluding deleted files. Exercise the real formatter
against temporary Git repositories and fail if the tool is missing.

Keep bootstrap peer confirmation restricted to plain IP addresses even when
GLib accepts and discards an IPv6 scope suffix. Extend the existing rejection
regression to both peer inputs. Include two formatting-only corrections.

Upstream-Status: Pending

